      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At run-time, you cannot easily get Texture Array information. So, we can't do a scan when it loads in for you.\n\nInstead, we'll use our server-side scanning for this.\n\nDue to a variety of factors, though, we have no ETA for this change, but it's definitely a known issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
