  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Texture Arrays (Tex2DArray) are not counted as part of the Texture Memory statistics (atleast when doing a matswap animation). This is a problem since texture arrays have the potential to be very large in size, and could lead to abuse.\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/8ej8z4.mp4",
